# Before: a neutral shape role in a Snowflake file: d2 ignores `decision`, the gate is a box.
...@snowflake-brand
direction: down
placed: Order placed {class: sf-node}
paid: Payment taken? {class: [decision; sf-primary]}
shipped: Shipped {class: sf-node}
placed -> paid: {class: sf-edge}
paid -> shipped: yes {class: sf-edge}
